{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Elemental Shifter",
    "steam_appid": 3577830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577830/extras/09853ce1a937d10b7117313ba1dcd10e.poster.avif?t=1751418783\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577830/extras/09853ce1a937d10b7117313ba1dcd10e.webm?t=1751418783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577830/extras/09853ce1a937d10b7117313ba1dcd10e.mp4?t=1751418783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Choose Your Warrior Path</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing rooms and defeating bosses, gain the option to choose from 25+ different Path's with over 10 unique game changing abilities and find that Path that gives you the perfect stats to show the true potential of your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Explore And Loot To Find New Weapons</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies and explore your randomly generated rooms to find chests with loot including 20+ different weapons ranging from Greatswords to Spears, all having 2 random activatable abilities with over 15 more to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577830/extras/c52b324ae5be156a1a1a43b9c3a64d26.poster.avif?t=1751418783\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577830/extras/c52b324ae5be156a1a1a43b9c3a64d26.webm?t=1751418783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577830/extras/c52b324ae5be156a1a1a43b9c3a64d26.mp4?t=1751418783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Clear Floors To Fight Difficult Bosses</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your map before challenging the Floor Boss, which if beaten allows you to move on to the next floor to find even more loot on your journey to the Mage King, with floor bosses ranging from powerful Orc's to mystical Dragon's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Complete Quests From Fallen Warriors</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your fellow Warriors who have fallen in battle and complete their wish to gain access to their warrior spirit, which when utilized allow you to have different starting equipment and passives before each playthrough of the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Improve Your Warrior Spirit Permanently</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you have fallen, use your fellow warriors soul's that you collected from defeating mages, to increase your strength and unlock new unique gameplay for your selected warrior spirit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Unearth The Truth About The Warriors Defeat From The Mages</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about the story behind the mages conquering and enslavement over your warrior clan, how they turned your clan against each other from the inside out and used their schemes to overpower you in a dastardly way.<br><strong><i><u></u></i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577830/extras/09853ce1a937d10b7117313ba1dcd10e.poster.avif?t=1751418783\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577830/extras/09853ce1a937d10b7117313ba1dcd10e.webm?t=1751418783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577830/extras/09853ce1a937d10b7117313ba1dcd10e.mp4?t=1751418783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Choose Your Warrior Path</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing rooms and defeating bosses, gain the option to choose from 25+ different Path's with over 10 unique game changing abilities and find that Path that gives you the perfect stats to show the true potential of your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Explore And Loot To Find New Weapons</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies and explore your randomly generated rooms to find chests with loot including 20+ different weapons ranging from Greatswords to Spears, all having 2 random activatable abilities with over 15 more to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577830/extras/c52b324ae5be156a1a1a43b9c3a64d26.poster.avif?t=1751418783\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577830/extras/c52b324ae5be156a1a1a43b9c3a64d26.webm?t=1751418783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577830/extras/c52b324ae5be156a1a1a43b9c3a64d26.mp4?t=1751418783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Clear Floors To Fight Difficult Bosses</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your map before challenging the Floor Boss, which if beaten allows you to move on to the next floor to find even more loot on your journey to the Mage King, with floor bosses ranging from powerful Orc's to mystical Dragon's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Complete Quests From Fallen Warriors</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your fellow Warriors who have fallen in battle and complete their wish to gain access to their warrior spirit, which when utilized allow you to have different starting equipment and passives before each playthrough of the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Improve Your Warrior Spirit Permanently</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you have fallen, use your fellow warriors soul's that you collected from defeating mages, to increase your strength and unlock new unique gameplay for your selected warrior spirit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Unearth The Truth About The Warriors Defeat From The Mages</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about the story behind the mages conquering and enslavement over your warrior clan, how they turned your clan against each other from the inside out and used their schemes to overpower you in a dastardly way.<br><strong><i><u></u></i></strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Elemental Shifter is a top-down 2D roguelite where you harness the power of 'Elemental Shifting' adapting your abilities based on the last damage you took. Choose your path, battle mages, grow stronger, discover new weapons and defeat powerful bosses on your way to the Mage King.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
